---
title: The life of an ask
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant A as The agent
  participant D as The daemon
  participant P as A person
  A->>D: calls ask: a question, options, a recommendation
  Note over A: The turn ends. The task sleeps, with no process.
  D->>P: the desk lists the ask: in the web view, Herdr and priory desk
  opt Or snooze it first
    P->>D: snoozes the ask, say for an hour
    D->>P: back on the desk when the time is up
  end
  P->>D: answers with an option or a text, at the ask's revision
  Note over D: The first answer stands and waits as the next prompt.
  D->>A: its next run resumes the session and types the answer as a prompt
  Note over A: The agent carries on with the answer.
